---
description: SCSS styling priority and reuse rules
globs:
  - "**/*.scss"
  - "**/*.css"
  - "**/stylesheets/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Maximise reuse, minimise new styles. Follow in order:
1. Reuse an existing app style.
2. Use a GOV.UK Design System style (search `node_modules/govuk-frontend`).
3. New style — last resort, needs explicit approval, must use the `app-` prefix.

Never duplicate existing styles. Extract and reuse hardcoded colours and dimensions.

Full conventions: @docs/standards/styling.md
